    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d397">

                <pb facs="0445" n="1179" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1179"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Taylor to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-03-25"><hi rendition="#italic">March 25,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Minister for foreign affairs said he was not in condition to speak of affairs of
                    the department of which he had been in charge only one day; <pb facs="0446"
                        n="1180" xml:id="pg1180"/> but he promised to consider <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Alliança</hi> incident before everything, assuring me of
                    his desire and hope that it will receive solution equal to his interest to
                    maintain reciprocal friendship and consideration existing between the two
                    nations.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Taylor.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
